    "text": "WLUC\nwebsite\nNegaunee\nNegaunee Elks Kids Day lets kids be kids with hundreds of other kids\nBy Griffin Weinberg,\n5 hours agoNEGAUNEE, Mich. (WLUC) - Letting kids be kids. “I was literally right in front of you, like I was, you were all the way at the back when I was all the way at the front,” said 10-year-old Karsyn Kibler to her friend, Bella Carr, whom she beat in an inflatable obstacle course race.\n1",
